Parent companion for FPGA-gPTP #85 in the milan_dp suite (rides the next
gptp-processor pin adoption, with parent-adoption-gptp_shadow-85.patch).
Applies to milan-fpga dev e9cbb676 with the gptp-processor gitlink at 2022d363.
The published path is pathTrace: the received pathSequence plus thisClock
appended when it is not empty, so each count gains one entry and each
GET_AS_PATH response gains eight bytes (one clockIdentity).
Every row: IEEE 802.1AS-2020 10.3.9.23 / 10.3.13.2.4 f) 5); the GET_AS_PATH
rows are served per IEEE 1722.1-2021 7.4.41.

tb/verilator/milan_dp/sim_gptp.cpp (legs gptp and gptp-lat; this leg's
thisClock is 02a1b2fffec3d4e5, named THIS_CLOCK):

| Line | Expectation | Was | Now |
|---|---|---:|---:|
| 984 | fabric live AS_PATH count ([GM, B1, B2, PEER] + thisClock) | 4 | 5 |
| 1044 | GET_AS_PATH full-tail wire length | 74 | 82 |
| 1046 | GET_AS_PATH cdl | 48 | 56 |
| 1048 | GET_AS_PATH count | 4 | 5 |
| new | GET_AS_PATH ends with thisClock (bytes 74..81) | - | THIS_CLOCK |
| 1399 | wait for the one-entry publication (loop exit count) | 1 | 2 |
| 1403 | explicit one-entry fabric PathTrace count ([GM] + thisClock) | 1 | 2 |
| 1414 | explicit one-entry GET_AS_PATH cdl | 24 | 32 |
| 1416 | explicit one-entry GET_AS_PATH count | 1 | 2 |
| new | explicit one-entry GET_AS_PATH ends with thisClock (bytes 50..57) | - | THIS_CLOCK |
| 1450 | in-flight response remains wholly old: count | 1 | 2 |

tb/verilator/milan_dp/sim_ax1x1gptp.cpp (the physical-rate leg run by
tb/verilator/milan_dp_gptp; its image's thisClock is 020000fffe000001,
named kThisClock):

| Line | Expectation | Was | Now |
|---|---|---:|---:|
| 938 | PathTrace count ([GM, parent] + thisClock) | 2 | 3 |
| 980 | GET_AS_PATH wire length (no longer the padded minimum) | 60 | 66 |
| 982 | GET_AS_PATH control data length | 32 | 40 |
| 983 | GET_AS_PATH padding bytes are zero (no padding remains) | removed | - |
| 984 | GET_AS_PATH ordered identities | 2 | 3 |
| new | GET_AS_PATH ends with thisClock (bytes 58..65) | - | kThisClock |

Apply from the parent root, after parent-adoption-gptp_shadow-85.patch:
git apply parent-adoption-milan_dp-85.patch

